{"id": "68699", "title": "法官前夫，滚", "author": "悬崖一壶茶", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 37, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68699.htm", "intro": "苏雅茉这辈子  \r\n最快乐的一件事就是和韩智谈了一场刻骨铭心的恋爱， \r\n结果——却以对方劈腿出国而告终； \r\n最疯狂的一件事就是和虞世靖闪婚，嫁入法官世家， \r\n但却——每天受到一大堆女人无穷无尽的骚扰； \r\n最得意的一件事就是在丈夫升为大法官的那一天提出离婚， \r\n然后——带着自己想要的一切潇洒离去； \r\n最后悔的一件事就是一时心软收留了樊天昊， \r\n从而——自己卷入他糜烂的私生活，再也逃脱不开… \r\n然而，当最后的最后， \r\n前男友震撼回归，前夫紧抓不放，富二代纠缠不休， \r\n还有婆婆后妈无尽的争吵，妹妹和小姑的打打闹闹， \r\n再加上前男友的前妻兼自己的前任闺蜜，前夫的小六小七，富二代的莺莺燕燕… \r\n她想问一句：只是想过着平平淡淡的生活，原来也这么难吗？", "base": "files/article/html/68/68699", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10542945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-11", "file": "10542946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-20", "file": "10542947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10542948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10542949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10542950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-53", "file": "10542951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "54-56", "file": "10542952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-58", "file": "10542953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "59-60", "file": "10542954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-62", "file": "10542955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "63-64", "file": "10542956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "65-66", "file": "10542957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "67-68", "file": "10542958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "69-70", "file": "10542959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-72", "file": "10542960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "73-74", "file": "10542961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "75-76", "file": "10542962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-78", "file": "10542963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "79-80", "file": "10542964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-82", "file": "10542965.html", "available": false}, {"title": "83-84", "file": "105429